# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system 439377f40e757eb6bf203f4b0a2cf342668c5c4266768b77db622e8a8dadddd6
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 2fa2958b4d626e0745bd3149ce2f6b62c8c2fe00a7a5087253c4cc61c052e408
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm 4b69066532854e57ae594140d46906c7e1a6a0a46618df73450c1799f0722a06
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xclock 4e294da30b33b7a7a7cc40028fa9499a67c30c9efc99fc2717f0db4b91444ab5
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xeyes 3e6f56bb77a21a08890db0ab9b0ab46ebf277ff1a50c39059b76a2c418693bab
